# s3-01a: the wincu-int computer stack merged onto the ft-fix core (non-hot files). No Cargo change: the new files use only crates
# mixdog-tools, mixdog-core and mixdog-app-server-daemon already depend on (mixdog-js, mixdog-rt, mixdog-protocol, mixdog-secure-desktop,
# regex, unicode-normalization, base64, bytes, futures, tokio, tokio-util, serde, serde_json, async-trait); no new workspace edge.

