# compose_flip.rs, fn real_core: two edits
file: native/core/crates/mixdog-app-server-daemon/src/compose_flip.rs
edit-1: in the `native_paths.computer_sessions(...)` call, the last argument (after `pre.state.publisher.clone(),`) is now the pool's settings; replace the whole block
        `{ // `isObserveOnly()` ... let config = config.clone(); Arc::new(move || config.desktop_settings().computer_observe_only) }`
        with
        `mixdog_core::run_host::native_tools::ComputerSettings::from_config(b.data_dir.clone(), config.clone())`
        (the wrap closure, RedactingComputerBackend under GatedComputerBackend with `human_only`, stays exactly as it is: it is the gate over the wincu pool).
        ObserveOnlySetting and ProcessComputerBackend::with_observe_only_setting no longer exist: the one implementation of "Observation only" is wincu's ComputerShared.observe_only.
edit-2: directly after `builder.register(live_view.clone())?;` add
        // computer/userControl: the Computer Use pill's Resume and Stop.
        builder.register(Arc::new(crate::computer_control::ComputerUserControlService::new(computer_pool.as_ref().map(|pool| pool.user_control()))))?;

